# Cursor rule placement (ULG ecosystem)

## Binary suffix (binding)

| Suffix | Meaning | Where (SoT) |
|---|---|---|
| `_ulg` | Shared across **all** ULG-ecosystem workspaces | `universal-llm-gateway/cursor-plugins/ulg-ecosystem/rules/{topic}_ulg.mdc` → installed plugin |
| `_ws` | Local to **this** checkout only | `{repo}/.cursor/rules/{topic}_ws.mdc` |

¬ put new `_ulg` rules under `/mnt/torus/projects/.cursor/rules/` — parent
inheritance + plugin would duplex on the hub. Plugin is the **sole** Cursor
discovery surface for `_ulg`.

Unsuffixed parent rules (legacy language/quality) may still live under
`projects/.cursor/rules/`; **new ecosystem-shared guidance uses `_ulg` in the plugin SoT**.

## When operator says “all workspaces” / “ecosystem” / “satellites”

1. Create `universal-llm-gateway/cursor-plugins/ulg-ecosystem/rules/{topic}_ulg.mdc`.
2. Append basename (no `.mdc`) to  
   `universal-llm-gateway/cursor-plugins/ulg-ecosystem/RULES_ULG_CENSUS.txt`.
3. Run `universal-llm-gateway/scripts/cursor/install-ecosystem-plugin.sh`.
4. Remind operator: **Developer: Reload Window**.

Same install+reload gate applies to ecosystem **skills** and **commands**
(always-on: `skill-surface_ulg.mdc` § Install after plugin SoT edit).

¬ hardlink into satellites. ¬ leave shared rules only under ULG or parent `.cursor/rules/`.

## Checkout-local (`_ws`)

IMAP hosts, env files, Stargate/gateway hub-only, IDE-boot quirks for one repo → `{repo}/.cursor/rules/*_ws.mdc` only. No census / no plugin step.

## Personal-life (binding)

`personal_life(rule ∨ skill ∨ helper) ⇒ ¬public(_ws ∨ _ulg ∨ scripts/)`.
Ignore in place (life-skill / employer-rule list) + nested git under `scripts.local/` when the workflow needs history.
Hub helpers → `universal-llm-gateway/scripts.local/`. Satellite-bound helpers → `{repo}/scripts.local/` (own nest).
The fleet hygiene rule itself is public: `personal-workflow-local-tracking_ulg`.
SOT: `decision:scripts-local-personal-helpers`.

